---
---

<section id="ai" class="sec">
	<div class="eyebrow">What I do now</div>
	<h2 class="sec-title"><span class="pr">~/</span>ai-enablement</h2>
	<div class="cols">
		<div class="col">
			<div class="eyebrow">Tools</div>
			<h3>Skills, libraries and MCPs</h3>
			<p>Internal libraries that plug AI agents into the development lifecycle through reusable skills.</p>
			<div class="chips">
				<span class="chip a">Claude Code</span><span class="chip a">OpenCode</span><span class="chip a">T3 Code</span>
				<span class="chip">MCP</span><span class="chip">Skills</span><span class="chip">LangChain</span><span class="chip">Ollama</span>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="col">
			<div class="eyebrow">Workflows</div>
			<h3>Agentic software factories</h3>
			<p>Autonomous flows with human-in-the-loop, so the team can focus on the business and the acceptance criteria.</p>
			<div class="chips">
				<span class="chip a">Human-in-the-loop</span><span class="chip">Context engineering</span><span class="chip">SDD</span>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="col">
			<div class="eyebrow">Impact</div>
			<h3>Teams that work differently</h3>
			<p>AI-assisted workflows adopted across several teams, faster delivery, and backend and frontend engineers picking up each other's tasks.</p>
			<div class="chips">
				<span class="chip">Productivity</span><span class="chip">Cross-functional</span><span class="chip">Quality gates</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="card">
		<div class="hd"><span class="eyebrow">Agentic software factory</span><span class="eyebrow">Diagram</span></div>
		<div class="fac">
			<svg class="d" viewBox="0 0 960 200" role="img" aria-label="Human defines business context and acceptance criteria, an autonomous agent factory runs spec, code, test and pull request, and a human reviews and approves.">
				<rect class="box" x="8" y="50" width="190" height="100" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="28" y="80">HUMAN</text><text class="t" x="28" y="106">Business intent</text><text x="28" y="128">Acceptance criteria</text>
				<rect class="zone" x="266" y="30" width="430" height="140" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="286" y="56">AGENT FACTORY · AUTONOMOUS</text>
				<rect class="box" x="286" y="82" width="80" height="56" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="326" y="115" text-anchor="middle">spec</text>
				<rect class="box" x="386" y="82" width="80" height="56" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="426" y="115" text-anchor="middle">code</text>
				<rect class="box" x="486" y="82" width="80" height="56" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="526" y="115" text-anchor="middle">test</text>
				<rect class="box" x="586" y="82" width="90" height="56" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="631" y="115" text-anchor="middle">PR</text>
				<path class="ln" d="M366 110H386M466 110H486M566 110H586"></path>
				<rect class="box" x="764" y="50" width="188" height="100" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="784" y="80">HUMAN</text><text class="t" x="784" y="106">Review</text><text x="784" y="128">Approve &amp; ship</text>
				<path class="ln" d="M198 100H266M696 100H764"></path>
				<path class="dm" d="M232 92l8 8-8 8-8-8z"></path><path class="dm" d="M730 92l8 8-8 8-8-8z"></path>
				<text x="232" y="132" text-anchor="middle">checkpoint</text><text x="730" y="132" text-anchor="middle">checkpoint</text>
			</svg>
			<svg class="m" viewBox="0 0 320 500" role="img" aria-label="Vertical flow: human defines business intent and acceptance criteria, then an autonomous agent factory runs spec, code, test and pull request, then a human reviews and approves.">
				<rect class="box" x="10" y="10" width="300" height="80" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="28" y="34">HUMAN</text><text class="t" x="28" y="56">Business intent</text><text x="28" y="76">Acceptance criteria</text>
				<path class="ln" d="M160 90V130"></path><path class="dm" d="M160 102l8 8-8 8-8-8z"></path><text x="178" y="114">checkpoint</text>
				<rect class="zone" x="10" y="130" width="300" height="236" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="28" y="154">AGENT FACTORY · AUTONOMOUS</text>
				<rect class="box" x="40" y="172" width="240" height="36" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="160" y="195" text-anchor="middle">spec</text>
				<rect class="box" x="40" y="218" width="240" height="36" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="160" y="241" text-anchor="middle">code</text>
				<rect class="box" x="40" y="264" width="240" height="36" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="160" y="287" text-anchor="middle">test</text>
				<rect class="box" x="40" y="310" width="240" height="36" rx="6"></rect><text class="t" x="160" y="333" text-anchor="middle">PR</text>
				<path class="ln" d="M160 208V218M160 254V264M160 300V310"></path>
				<path class="ln" d="M160 366V406"></path><path class="dm" d="M160 378l8 8-8 8-8-8z"></path><text x="178" y="390">checkpoint</text>
				<rect class="box" x="10" y="406" width="300" height="80" rx="8"></rect>
				<text x="28" y="430">HUMAN</text><text class="t" x="28" y="452">Review</text><text x="28" y="472">Approve &amp; ship</text>
			</svg>
		</div>
		<p class="motto">Humans own the <em>why</em> and the <em>what</em>. Agents handle the <em>how</em>.</p>
	</div>
</section>
